      "content": "but that's the thing... there isn't really anyone to reach out to. everyone i know expects me to be the person i used to be. and even if they knew, the world just feels so hostile. like no matter how much i fight for myself, the cost is just always going to be higher than what i get back. it feels like it's just a losing battle.",
